rows.en:
Heh heh...
Hopeless Okawa.
She had drive enough to dig up a grave, so why didn't she try to walk the road of her fate on her own strength?{p}

Once everyone had mostly finished their drinks, Hino leaned forward.
It {f:seemed|looked like} he was finally going to tell us the last story.
Everyone braced themselves.
...Come to think of it, {f:did Hino even like scary stories?|I wondered if Hino even liked scary stories.}
I'd never really heard anything like that about him{f:, but|, but} you can't judge a person by appearances.
Maybe that had shown on {f:my|my} face{f:.|.}{p}
